WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.300
thanks for saving me back then.

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:31.000
see you next time, Harry.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.233
Malfoy!

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:43.533
Harry.

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:47.233
did you have a good holiday?

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:53.266
Malfoy..

00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:57.900
I'm serious.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.233
then prove it.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:03.066
don't get the wrong idea
you hang around with mudbloods.

